---
// src/components/partners/AgencyCapabilities.astro
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-3">Core Deliverables</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-4">
        What Agency Partners Hand Off to Us
      </h3>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        You focus on client relationships, strategy, and high-ticket sales. We execute the heavy instructional design and technical implementation behind the scenes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 hover:border-brand-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Kajabi Platform Ecosystems</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Full site builds, course product setup, custom checkout funnels, community hub setups, and multi-tier email automations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Custom Liquid & CSS styling</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Webinar & sales funnel setup</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Payment webhook automations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 hover:border-brand-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-accent/15 text-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">Instructional Architecture</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Curriculum design from messy client materials. We develop structured modules, real-world case scenarios, rubrics, and quizzes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> ADDIE & backward curriculum design</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Formative & summative assessments</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> SME interview distillation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 hover:border-brand-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">LMS Re-Platforming & Migration</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Migrating complex client academies between platforms with zero data loss, preserved user progression, and seamless cutovers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Teachable/Thinkific to Kajabi</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Moodle/Canvas enterprise export</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> User database & completion mapping</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 hover:border-brand-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-accent/15 text-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-3">SCORM, xAPI & WCAG 2.2 AA</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Packaging Articulate 360 courses for enterprise compliance, Section 508 / ADA accessibility audits, and multi-language localization.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-500 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> SCORM 1.2, 2004 & cmi5 packages</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility audit</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-brand-accent">&check;</span> Multi-language translation & RTL</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
